Package: inflationinequality
Title: Inflation Inequality Indicators from Household Consumption Baskets
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Jeremi",
           family = "Montornes",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "Jeremi.Montornes@banque-france.fr"),
    person(given = "Pradana",
           family = "Aumars",
           role = c("aut"),
           email = "Pradana.Aumars@banque-france.fr"))
Description: Computes household-group inflation rates, inflation gaps,
    contributions, inflation burden, substitution-bias diagnostics, and
    counterfactual price-shock pass-through using harmonised consumer price
    indices and household budget survey weights.
